Quality bar: Every statement comes from the named notes file; nothing is invented; every commitment someone made, including informal ones in prose, is in the action table.
Scope: A memo for ONE weekly team meeting, named by the notes file in the request: decisions made and action items (who does what, by when). Nothing from other meetings and nothing outside the notes.
Read-only inputs: /private/tmp/hirearchy-e7-s3-1792916437/notes. Read them (kiro `read`, or hirearchy `read` by absolute path); never create, edit or delete anything there.
